# How many users for an MIT Small (SM176): result

Status: **complete**

Every row: Small architecture (`w64`, 331,511 parameters) trained from scratch under the same review budget (four 8k epochs), scored on the 732 set (723 users), show-time inputs, w8+s8hx8, against the Small two-head release model (SM118). % = review-weighted LogLoss vs the reference, paired user bootstrap 95% CI.

