## Held-out slice (early stopping; 190 validation users never trained on, not in the 732 set)

- 8,000 users, with the usual teacher (SM176 n8000-kd): epoch 1: 0.3100 (+0.00%), epoch 2: 0.3061 (-1.26%), epoch 3: 0.3085 (-0.46%). early stop: eval point 3 is not 0.05% below the best earlier point; decay 1 epoch(s) from epoch 2.
- 1,000 users, no teacher (SM176 n1000): epoch 4: 0.3155 (+0.00%), epoch 8: 0.3121 (-1.10%), epoch 12: 0.3097 (-1.86%), epoch 16: 0.3096 (-1.89%). early stop: eval point 16 is not 0.05% below the best earlier point; decay 3 epoch(s) from epoch 16.
- 2,000 users, no teacher (SM176 n2000): epoch 2: 0.3164 (+0.00%), epoch 4: 0.3167 (+0.10%). early stop: eval point 4 is not 0.05% below the best earlier point; decay 1 epoch(s) from epoch 2.
- 4,000 users, no teacher (SM176 n4000): epoch 1: 0.3149 (+0.00%), epoch 2: 0.3139 (-0.31%), epoch 3: 0.3090 (-1.86%), epoch 4: 0.3080 (-2.18%), epoch 5: 0.3080 (-2.19%). early stop: eval point 5 is not 0.05% below the best earlier point; decay 1 epoch(s) from epoch 5.

